        "original_id": "9d3e82db-bc4b-5026-b116-de656b9c9b08",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Taylor Swift, Shellback, Adam Levine, Benny Blanco, Zaeden, Krishna Kedia, Justin Bieber\n- Albums: 1989, Red\n- Songs: Animals, Magic, Don't Wanna Know, Love Yourself\n- Roles: songwriter, record producer, musician, singer\n\nFacts:\n- Taylor Swift began composing the album 1989 after releasing her previous studio album Red in 2012.\n- Karl Johan Schuster, known professionally as Shellback, was born on 1 February 1985.\n- Shellback is a Swedish songwriter, record producer, and musician.\n- The song \"Animals\" by Maroon 5 was written by Adam Levine, Benny Blanco, and Shellback.\n- Shellback also produced the song \"Animals.\"\n- Zaeden is best known for his remixes of Coldplay's \"Magic,\" Maroon 5's \"Animals\" and \"Don't Wanna Know,\" and Justin Bieber's \"Love Yourself.\"\n- Zaeden is the brother of singer Krishna Kedia.",
